title: Decrease the log level for claim queue inconsistency in `ClaimQueueState`
doc:
- audience: Node Dev
  description: |-
    Decrease the log level of "Inconsistency while adding a leaf to the `ClaimQueueState`..." log
    message from WARN to DEBUG.

    On session change the validators in the active set are reshuffled and end up in different backing
    groups. In this case we start fetching the claim queue for the newly assigned core and the
    future assignments in `ClaimQueueState` are no longer valid so overwriting them is the right
    thing to do.
crates:
- name: polkadot-collator-protocol
  bump: patch
